+    Accelerate's own `zero3_init_context_manager` cannot turn this off, because
+    `set_deepspeed_weakref` installs the HfDeepSpeedConfig regardless of
+    `zero3_init_flag`, so we clear the weakref it keys off of directly.
+    """
